  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.17.3 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): validate PIPX_MAX_LOGS before logging setup by @hktitof in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2029\n* fix(runpip): stop the uv backend from printing DEBUG logs by @anandghegde in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2035\n* 🧪 test: sync lock tests on events, not wall-clock time by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2038\n* doc: list every --pip-args flag the uv backend translates by @hxperl in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2037\n* fix(cli): split --pip-args with shell quoting by @r3wretrhy in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2033\n\n## New Contributors\n* @hktitof made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2029\n* @anandghegde made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2035\n* @hxperl made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2037\n* @r3wretrhy made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2033\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.17.2...1.17.3",
